# 通用文案：应用名、按钮、相对时间、语言名称、空状态。键以 `common-` 开头。

-app-name = Lectern

## 语言选择器。语言名称用该语言自身的写法，两种资源相同。

common-language-en = English
common-language-zh-cn = 简体中文
common-language-system = 跟随系统

## 按钮

common-ok = 好
common-cancel = 取消
common-close = 关闭
common-retry = 重试
common-restart = 重新启动 { -app-name }

## 相对时间。Strings::relative_time 选择消息；$count 是整数。

common-time-just-now = 刚刚
common-time-minutes-ago = { $count } 分钟前
common-time-hours-ago = { $count } 小时前
common-time-days-ago = { $count } 天前
common-time-weeks-ago = { $count } 周前
common-time-months-ago = { $count } 个月前
common-time-years-ago = { $count } 年前

## 空状态

common-empty = 暂无内容
